<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef prices were generally weak on mostly moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice middle meats were weak, while chuck and round cuts ranged steady to weak. Beef trimmings sold steady to weak on mostly moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
